:"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"One sensor sweep, one request per account. The signal data is shared, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"collection identity is not: every account gets its own","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/ios-sdk-sensor.TrustSignals\/documentation\/TrustSignals\/TSCollection\/collectionId","type":"reference"},{"text":", so a host can tell the per-account copies","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"apart on the client side. Each account carries its own identity and token, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"single batch can span several services.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Accounts are independent, so some can succeed while others fail. The returned"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/ios-sdk-sensor.TrustSignals\/documentation\/TrustSignals\/TSUploadOutcome"},{"type":"text","text":" names both: "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/ios-sdk-sensor.TrustSignals\/documentation\/TrustSignals\/TSUploadOutcome\/uploaded"},{"type":"text","text":" keyed by account,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/ios-sdk-sensor.TrustSignals\/documentation\/TrustSignals\/TSUploadOutcome\/failures"},{"type":"text","text":" with the reason each other account did not make"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it. Those failures also reach "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/ios-sdk-sensor.TrustSignals\/documentation\/TrustSignals\/TrustSignalsSDK\/registerErrorHandler(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" one by one, which is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the channel scheduled cycles use. A single-account call reports the same way,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"via the thrown error — there’s only one account to report."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This call throws only when the collection itself failed or when "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"no","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" account"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"could be uploaded — a partial failure is reported, not thrown, so it cannot"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hide the accounts that succeeded. Total failure throws "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/ios-sdk-sensor.TrustSignals\/documentation\/TrustSignals\/TSUploadError","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carrying that same per-account failure map, so a caller can tell which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tokens to refresh even when no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TSUploadOutcome"},{"type":"text","text":" comes back."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Throws ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ios-sdk-sensor.TrustSignals\/documentation\/TrustSignals\/TSError\/noAccountsProvided","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for an empty array, ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ios-sdk-sensor.TrustSignals\/documentation\/TrustSignals\/TSError\/blankAccountId","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"if any account is blank, ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ios-sdk-sensor.TrustSignals\/documentation\/TrustSignals\/TSError\/missingAccessToken","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" if any token is empty,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ios-sdk-sensor.TrustSignals\/documentation\/TrustSignals\/TSError\/invalidIdentifier(field:reason:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" if any identity field breaks its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"te